    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cruise full of beautiful women and... Sudoku. This puzzle game brings you closer to uncovering the stories behind each girl you meet. From the quirky artist to the spirited DJ, every encounter is a chance to impress, connect, and maybe even spark something deeper. Can you solve your way to love and friendship before the cruise ends? Or will your puzzle pieces remain scattered?</p>",
